OL,3,B"Don't wake up at 36"   Finland spends 
OL,4,BE250k educating uni students about     
OL,5,Bfertility                              
OL,6,GIn its latest effort to encourage      
OL,7,Gpeople to have children, the government
OL,8,Gwants young people to understand their 
OL,9,Gbiological clock.                      
OL,10,K                                       
OL,11,BFrom fries to fuel: Finland turns burnt
OL,12,Bpotato crop into transport biogas      
OL,13,GMillions of potatoes damaged in a fire 
OL,14,Gare being turned into biomethane.      
OL,15,K                                       
OL,16,BWSJ: Stubb and St re contacted Putin   
OL,17,Bwith help of Russian oligarch          
OL,18,GThe two leaders wanted to assure Russia
OL,19,Gthat Nato would not blockade its ships 
OL,20,Gin the Baltic.                         
