OL,3,BTemperatures to plunge to -20C in      
OL,4,Bnorthern Finland                       
OL,5,GParts of Finland are in for a cold snap
OL,6,Gover the coming days as high pressure  
OL,7,Gpushes dry, colder air into the country
OL,8,Gfrom the north.                        
OL,9,K                                       
OL,10,BFinns say state support for families   
OL,11,Bfalls short                            
OL,12,GThe Family Federation's survey recorded
OL,13,Gthe worst results since its family     
OL,14,Gbarometer began in 2014.               
OL,15,K                                       
OL,16,BFinland's oldest man is last surviving 
OL,17,Bmale Winter War veteran                
OL,18,GIlmari Koppinen, 108, is Finland's     
OL,19,Goldest man and the last surviving male 
OL,20,Gveteran of the Winter War.             
